The prisoner.  Starts with a +0 shiv (knife), a +0 striped shirt or
orange jumpsuit, and a ball and chain attached.  Create a new weapon
skill: iron ball, which only prisoners can learn to Basic.

I've always thought the ball and chain is an incredibly cool idea, and
if i'm not mistaken, is among the most damaging items in the game. 
Why not make it a weapon skill?  Perhaps can be used from two squares
away like a polearm (swinging it around by the chain) (only after
Basic skill is attained)... Could be very powerful for low-level
characters, despite weighing a ton...

